# Leyline of Resonance: the copy may have new targets (CR 707.10c). Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at its own Llanowar Elves (the Bolt targets
# only a single creature Bot1 controls), the trigger copies it, and Bot1 aims the copy at Bot2: the copy resolves first (3 damage to
# Bot2), then the original kills the Elves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Forest
Mountain
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Lightning Bolt
